@startuml seq-conduct-status

title conduct status — Show Deployment State

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #444

actor "User" as user
participant "cmd/" as cmd
participant "state/" as state
participant "Filesystem" as fs

== Single deployment ==

user -> cmd : conduct status <deployment>
cmd -> state : Load(name)
state -> fs : read ~/.local/share/conduct/<name>.json
state --> cmd : *DeploymentState
cmd --> user : name, status, created, updated\n+ node table (Node | Host | Status) on stdout

== All deployments ==

user -> cmd : conduct status
cmd -> state : List()
state -> fs : read every *.json in state dir\n(unreadable/corrupt files silently skipped)
state --> cmd : []DeploymentState
cmd --> user : table (Deployment | Status | Nodes | Updated)\non stdout
cmd --> user : "No deployments found." on stderr, exit 0\n(when state dir empty or missing)

== Errors ==

user -> cmd : conduct status <unknown>
cmd --> user : "deployment not found" on stderr, exit 1

@enduml
